{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的叙事切分较碎，段落之间的自然衔接不如Y，部分感受词块也略显堆叠。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】直接凸显每段心理落点，短句更适合边听边扫；感受细节又能随音乐节点出现，让观众既抓得到人物在想什么，也能感受到音乐如何推动情绪变化。Y的叙事更连贯，人物行为的因果解释也更自然，但左侧句子偏长，短时间内不容易迅速抓住重点，而且不少具体的音乐变化和细腻的情绪转折被概括掉了。综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "af397be5-4ccd-4f35-a17b-62b6f066780f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T164625811690Z", "elapsed_seconds": 107.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:48:13.598509+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8f9e33cbf1e15efad4dbebefca8caa7af860fc2ee8e57d0d30b25ad38d3b4ff0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f630